==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] (400%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] (400%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**10 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**10 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use powerful [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] for most of the Gories in this stage. The Gory Darks can be dealt with more easily through using something like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]], and the Zories can be dealt with more easily through using [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer Cats]].

==Trivia==
*The stage's name is a reference to [[wikipedia:Wars of the Roses|Wars of the Roses]].

